,{"id":6534960,"name":"Lara-Sophie Born","role":"Vali"},{"id":3228690,"name":"Bertram Maxim Gärtner","role":"Deutscher Grenzbeamter"},{"id":1323198,"name":"Hans-Caspar Gattiker","role":"Schweizer Grenzbeamter"},{"id":6061343,"name":"Martin Allemann","role":"Nazi Vater"},{"id":46835,"name":"Andreas Matti","role":"Schreibwarenverkäufer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kFPCRF9weP4iHBaG04o52GSIeD8.jpg"},{"id":6534964,"name":"Philipp Schombacher","role":"Hitlerjunge"},{"id":1958039,"name":"Nils Wolf","role":"Hitlerjunge"},{"id":6534966,"name":"Ruby Harder","role":"Chinesin"},{"id":4447521,"name":"Robert Feldmaier","role":"Nazi Journalist"},{"id":6534968,"name":"Madeline Kochova"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Quando Hitler rubò il coniglio rosa","overview":"La storia vera di una famiglia nella Berlino del 1933. Hitler è salito al potere. Anna ha solo nove anni. Per sfuggire ai nazisti, suo padre scappa a Zurigo e tutta la famiglia lo segue poco dopo. Comincia la loro fuga attraverso l'Europa alla ricerca di un luogo sicuro dove stabilirsi. Anna è costretta a lasciare tutto, compreso il suo amato coniglio rosa di peluche, e, insieme alla sua famiglia, dovrà affrontare una nuova vita piena di sfide e difficoltà, ma non senza speranza e perfino sorrisi."},{"language":"en-US","title":"When Hitler Stole Pink Rabbit","overview":"In 1933 in Berlin. Anna is only nine years old when her life changes from the ground up. To escape the Nazis, her father Arthur Kemper, a well-known Jewish journalist, has to flee to Zurich. His family, Anna, her twelve-year-old brother Max and her mother Dorothea, follow him shortly thereafter. Anna has to leave everything behind, including her beloved pink rabbit, and to face a new life full of challenges and privations abroad.","tagline":"A Family's Escape. A Childhood Lost."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Deutschland, 1933: Die kleine Anna Kemper lebt mit ihrer Familie in Berlin. Da ihr Vater, ein berühmter Theaterkritiker, offener Gegner der Nationalsozialisten ist, muss er nach Hitlers Machtübernahme nach Zürich flüchten. Die Mutter, Anna und ihr zwölfjähriger Bruder folgen ihm bald nach. Weil kaum Zeit für die Vorbereitung der Flucht bleibt, muss Anna in der Eile ausgerechnet ihr geliebtes Stoffkaninchen zurücklassen. Doch auch in der Schweiz findet die Familie keine dauerhafte Bleibe. Immer wieder muss sich Anna den sich ständig ändernden Umständen anpassen, ist mit ihrer Familie vor immer neue Herausforderungen gestellt und mit großen Entbehrungen konfrontiert. Trotzdem versucht Anna, den Mut nicht zu verlieren."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZiEOdoqUIphKc3MifhE0oNh37c.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n1AvnrJZ6F6hRoDhpTB1K9s19dF.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":581518,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZiEOdoqUIphKc3MifhE0oNh37c.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ZiEOdoqUIphKc3MifhE0oNh37c.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZiEOdoqUIphKc3MifhE0oNh37c.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ZiEOdoqUIphKc3MifhE0oNh37c.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/anT5DO3VqS0nh4ZkQDyss3eq8Ea.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/anT5DO3VqS0nh4ZkQDyss3eq8Ea.jpg","language":"it","width":1365,"height":2048}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k9GJufkrzJkvWmgLNHeVc3wz3T6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k9GJufkrzJkvWmgLNHeVc3wz3T6.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":300